                                ; 051: what does M80 put in the address column for EQU and DEFL? A
                                ; label is there, so Tatara shows the location counter - and I think
                                ; M80 shows the VALUE. 052 acts on whatever this says
  0005                          foo     equ     5
  0007                          bar     defl    7
  0000'   05                    t0:     db      foo
  0001'   07                            db      bar
                                        end
^L      MSX.M-80 2.00   27-Sep-26       PAGE    S


